// Pestiféré (class 12) - the healer tree "Sangsue" (.agents/plans/pestifere/pestifere-healer.DESIGN.md).
//
// The healer never casts: its melee hits trade their damage for healing (Transfusion). Once a hit's damage is final
// the most injured group member is found, and the share of the hit that covers what it is missing heals it instead
// of being dealt; the combat log shows that share absorbed. A group at full health takes nothing: every hit is
// damage. Every active picks its ally itself.
//
// Spell data contract (rows generated by localTools/patchSinisterStrike.ps1):
//   90300 Transfusion         the talent rank, a dummy aura the damage hook reads
//   90301 Transfusion         never cast: the spell Transfusion's healing is logged under
//   90302 Sangsue             EFFECT_0 weapon damage, EFFECT_1 SPELL_AURA_PERIODIC_DAMAGE on the enemy (the leech)
//   90303 Saignée             one weapon damage effect; the trade reads its id
//   90304 Absorption morbide  EFFECT_0 SPELL_EFFECT_DUMMY on the caster
//   90305 Don de sang         EFFECT_0 SPELL_EFFECT_DUMMY on the caster
//   90306 Symbiote            EFFECT_0 SPELL_EFFECT_DUMMY on the caster; puts 90307 on the chosen ally
//   90307 Symbiote            EFFECT_0 dummy, EFFECT_1 SPELL_AURA_MOD_DAMAGE_PERCENT_TAKEN (Sang de l'hôte)
//   90308 Pestilence salvatrice  a dummy aura on the caster the trade reads
//   90309 Coagulation         EFFECT_0 SPELL_AURA_MOD_DAMAGE_PERCENT_TAKEN on the ally healed
//   90310 Réserve de sang     a dummy aura on the caster while hits are banked
//   90311 Contagion bénigne   never cast: names the healing Contagion gives (PestifereScripts.cpp)
//   90312 Spores              EFFECT_0 SPELL_AURA_PERIODIC_HEAL on the ally (a proc of Transfusion)
//   90313 / 90314             never cast: name the Pustule éclatante and Essaim procs' healing
//   90315 Brume pestilentielle   EFFECT_0 SPELL_EFFECT_DUMMY on the caster; puts 90316 on the group around
//   90316 Brume pestilentielle   EFFECT_0 SPELL_AURA_PERIODIC_HEAL on a group member
//   90317 Caillot             EFFECT_0 SPELL_AURA_SCHOOL_ABSORB on the Symbiote's bearer, its amount set here
//   90318 Hémostase           a dummy aura on the healer, a stack per hit left to triple

